; Sprites: cone (4 frames), balloon on legs (4 frames)
;
; Eight 16x16 sprites of 32 bytes, 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes each (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel). Sprite
; F of the page is at $BB00+32*F. Entity definitions (#R$A000) name the page in byte +5 and pick F from the animation
; phase, the direction and the slot data. The sprites are drawn with #R$9456 (#R$91BE) and have no colour of their own:
; ink and bright come from the entity definition. Frames 0-3 look like a dark blob over a checkered cone; frames 4-7
; look like a checkered balloon with a bar and two stick legs. Used by entity definitions $2E $2F $37 $39 $6C in rooms
; $08 $0C $19 $2A $32.
@label=SpritesConeBalloon
